R-SO14 case (1) applies, not exit 18, with the platform of the operand as the package (R-SO23): the facts of the platform hash are read (`db_query facts`) before the pick.
Run 1: non-interactive, no flag: exit 13 (`1 compiler download (74.2 MB) needs consent`, R-DL5, R-EC13). The list is read and kept first (the gate comes after the list read), but nothing is downloaded, nothing is built and nothing is written to `config.toml` or `smoke`.
